          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">This notebook computes the response of an undamped free vibration system with <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(N||)</marimo-tex> degrees of freedom, governed by the system of differential equations</span>\n<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||[\n\\boldsymbol m  \\ddot{\\boldsymbol{x}}(t) + \\boldsymbol k  \\boldsymbol{x}(t) = \\boldsymbol{0},\n||]</marimo-tex><span class=\"paragraph\">with <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\boldsymbol{x}(0) = \\boldsymbol{x}_0||)</marimo-tex> and  <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\dot{\\boldsymbol{x}}(0) = \\dot{\\boldsymbol{x}}_0||)</marimo-tex>.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
